Date: Tue, 18 Nov 2025 18:01:46 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] PDF-2105: Integrate QPDF library for PDF-to-JSON conversion

- Add QPDF dependency to main BUILD.gn
- Implement IPDF_QPDF_PDFToJSON and IPDF_QPDF_FreeString public APIs
- Create fpdfsdk/fpdf_qpdf.cpp with QPDF integration
- Add public/ipdf_qpdf.h header following PDFium API conventions
- Enable WASM export for QPDF functions

This integration allows PDFium to convert PDF documents to QPDF's JSON
format for detailed PDF structure analysis and manipulation.
